# FUNDA360 – SPRINT 1 IMPLEMENTATION GUIDE

**Project:** Funda360  
**Company:** Auris Nexus Technologies  
**Sprint:** Sprint 1 – Foundation & Core Platform  
**Duration:** 2 Weeks (Flexible)  
**Sprint Goal:** Establish a production-ready enterprise foundation upon which all future modules will be built.

---

# Sprint Objective

Sprint 1 focuses exclusively on building the application's technical foundation.

No business modules (Admissions, Learners, Finance, Attendance, etc.) will be implemented during this sprint.

By the end of Sprint 1, users should be able to:

- Access Funda360
- Log in securely
- Stay authenticated
- Navigate the application
- View a professional dashboard
- Experience responsive enterprise-quality UI
- Work within a secure multi-tenant environment

